175	\begin{definition}[Win predicate of the classical low individual degree game]\label{def:ld-win-predicate}
176		\uses{def:ld-game, def:ld-question-distribution, def:line, def:polyfunc}
177		Fix $\mathsf{ldparams} = (q,m,d,k)$. Answers in the game $\mathfrak{G}^{\mathrm{ld}}_{\mathsf{ldparams}}$ take the following forms, depending on the question type; answers not of the prescribed form are rejected.
178		\begin{itemize}
179			\item Type $\mathsf{Point}$, question content $u \in \F_q^m$: the answer is an element of $\F_q^k$.
